EQUIPMENT MAINTENANCE
ALGORITHMS / CONCEPTS USED

Lab 1 - Multiplicative; fixed demo key/parameters: 15
Lab 2 - AES-192-CBC; fresh IV; PKCS#7 padding
Lab 3 - ECDH; protects the randomly generated document encryption key
Lab 5 - MD5; stored content digest and client-side digest comparison
Lab 6 - RSA-2048 PKCS#1 v1.5 with SHA-256; signs document ID, author and content
Lab 7 - ElGamal homomorphic multiplication
Lab 8 - Paillier encrypted keyword hashes and IDs; private-key owner scan (PKSE teaching approximation)

Lab 4 is not included: no Rabin, KMS service, rotation or revocation exercises.
The simple role menu, TCP sockets, JSON messages and audit log mirror the
hospital reference; they are application scaffolding, not a Lab 4 module.
Signature and search helpers use SHA-256 independently of the Lab 5 digest.
